# ---- Email (Resend) -------------------------------------------------------
# The Resend API key is a SERVER secret. Do NOT put it in any VITE_* variable —
# anything prefixed with VITE_ is bundled into the browser and would be public.
#
# 1) Put your key on the server that runs the send function (see
#    server/send-email.example.ts), as an environment variable:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_key_here
#
# 2) Deploy that function and point the client at its URL:
VITE_EMAIL_ENDPOINT=https://your-app.example.com/api/send-email
#
# 3) Optional default From address (must be a verified Resend domain/sender):
VITE_EMAIL_FROM=Synapse <no-reply@yourdomain.com>
